artifacts:
  - $route/1.3.intake.gaps.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-no-guessed-values
      say: |
        did you fill any gap with a guess? a gap must stay open until a fact
        or a test closes it (absence-of-evidence is not evidence-of-absence).
    - slug: has-gap-triage
      say: |
        is each gap tagged cheap-to-close (ask) vs test-needed (feeds phase 4)?
        an untriaged gap cannot route to the assay.
